    "description": "Farm (farmhouse), level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. The farmer's house: a 9 x 5 timber-framed farmhouse (plaster in dark oak, spruce gable roof, brick chimney) with hearth, bed, table, chests; composter and hay under the front eave. L2 adds a porch, shutters, flower boxes, gable trim, woodpile, hay loft; L3 a 15-tall tower windmill beside it. The fields are separate modules (farm_field_*). Not yet builder-tested: white_wool. Decoration step adds: item_frame, potted_plant.",
    "changes": "Rebuilt as one big, detailed timber farmhouse the farmer lives in (the fields are now separate one-level modules around it), with fences that connect and, at L3, a much bigger tower windmill with a stage, cap and four wool sails.",
